Local decision inference
Sailry bundles unmodified official llama.cpp b11756 shared libraries and their ggml
runtime dependencies from https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp.
Pinned archive and member checksums are in scripts/package/llama-runtime.lock.json.
The original MIT license and provenance remain in third_party_licenses/llama-LICENSE
and third_party_licenses/llama.md. The Windows OpenMP runtime retains its license
in third_party_licenses/llvm-OpenMP-LICENSE.
